jumpers per aircraft.

395
00:24:57.200 --> 00:25:00.500
All you have to do is 
remember what you were taught.

396
00:25:00.500 --> 00:25:04.900
and I guarantee you gravity 
will take care of the rest.

397
00:25:04.900 --> 00:25:07.500
Go. go. go. go!

398
00:25:12.700 --> 00:25:15.300
Go. go. go!

399
00:25:19.200 --> 00:25:21.800
Go. go. go!

400
00:25:49.700 --> 00:25:50.700
Damnit.

401
00:25:51.500 --> 00:25:53.000
And. gentlemen. 
rest assured.

402
00:25:53.000 --> 00:25:57.000
any refusals in the 
aircraft or at the door...

403
00:25:57.200 --> 00:26:00.200
and I guarantee you. 
you will...

404
00:26:00.700 --> 00:26:03.400
