405
00:26:03.400 --> 00:26:04.600
Four okay.

406
00:26:04.600 --> 00:26:05.800
Three okay.

407
00:26:05.800 --> 00:26:06.700
Two okay.

408
00:26:06.700 --> 00:26:07.400
One okay.

409
00:26:07.400 --> 00:26:10.000
Stand in the door.

410
00:26:11.700 --> 00:26:14.400
Go!

411
00:26:24.500 --> 00:26:28.200
1000. 2000. 3000. 
4000. 5000. 6000.

412
00:26:29.800 --> 00:26:32.500
7000. 8000. 9000!

413
00:26:36.700 --> 00:26:39.300
Hi-ho. Silver.

414
00:26:43.000 --> 00:26:46.500
Now just think. if you had 
any class or style like me.

415
00:26:46.500 --> 00:26:48.200
Somebody might 
mistake you for somebody.

416
00:26:48.200 --> 00:26:51.600
You mean like 
your fucking sergeant?

417
00:26:52.900 --> 00:26:55.600
I'm just kidding.

418
00:26:56.400 --> 00:26:57.900
Congratulations. Martin.

419
00:26:57.900 --> 00:27:02.600
Corporal Toye. there will be 
no leaning in my company.

420
00:27:02.600 --> 00:27:05.200
Are those dusty 
jump wings?

421
00:27:05.900 --> 00:27:08.800
How do you expect 
to slay the huns

422
00:27:08.800 --> 00:27:10.900
with dust on 
your jump wings?

423
00:27:10.900 --> 00:27:13.300
Luz. just give me a drink.

424
00:27:13.300 --> 00:27:16.000
Hell of an idea. Joe.

425
00:27:17.200 --> 00:27:18.700
There you go.

426
00:27:19.000 --> 00:27:22.100
Three miles up. 
three miles down.

427
00:27:24.400 --> 00:27:27.000
Ten-hut!

428
00:27:34.800 --> 00:27:37.400
Well. at ease. 
paratroopers.

429
00:27:38.500 --> 00:27:40.700
Good evening. 
Easy company.

430
00:27:40.700 --> 00:27:41.400
Evening. sir.

431
00:27:41.400 --> 00:27:43.800
Now. parachute infantry 
is a brand new concept

432
00:27:43.800 --> 00:27:45.700
